{"id":3116,"bodyHtml":"<DIV><div><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=eL4AyVLlC4Mz9bLhR6fMlLbUlLZU4M3VM8-aM8UDo7U8LRl0gihFp2hmCIa0n1ysLSyYU1hkUzQRo7CDnz7bU474ozCbLRvbUznRM8L8LRfFoR-ZLNn7oznFLzUao77Jv2bjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47PLRU0LzGDMmLJqdBnx&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=10663&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/F712BBA6C8F6E19C13969079A4C7C400/8282DD94/1408A\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 219px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=eL4AyVLlC4Mz9bLhR6fMlLbUlLZU4M3VM8-aM8UDo7U8LRl0gihFp2hmCIa0n1ysLSyYU1hkUzQRo7CDnz7bU474ozCbLRvbUznRM8L8LRfFoR-ZLNn7oznFLzUao77Jv2bjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47PLRU0LzGDMmLJqdBnx&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=10663&e=.png\"></p><p>王刀郎，安徽宿州人，预备党员，计算机科学与技术学院数据科学与大数据专业2022级本科生。现任班级组织委员兼科技委员，2025年本科生国家奖学金获得者，现已推免至厦门大学医学院健康大数据与智能医学专业攻读硕士学位。<img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=enmNy8olUDLm-inhNLYnzT2nN7Do7M3kUN7bL47PLmLboRl0gihFp2hmCIa0USh7U1yaUShkL4fkLRCbUmVkn7l8nNQVoRf7UNU4Um-YL4MFL47YM87YUmAFLmLiMN7Jv2bjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47PLRU0LzGDMmLJqdBnx&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=10663&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/ADB0AB30B069B1BDE4FFE80DBD3B2233/3127A2B8/2356A\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 226px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=enmNy8olUDLm-inhNLYnzT2nN7Do7M3kUN7bL47PLmLboRl0gihFp2hmCIa0USh7U1yaUShkL4fkLRCbUmVkn7l8nNQVoRf7UNU4Um-YL4MFL47YM87YUmAFLmLiMN7Jv2bjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47PLRU0LzGDMmLJqdBnx&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=10663&e=.png\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=enmNy8olUDLm-inhNLYnzT2nN7Do7M3kUN7bL47PLmLboRl0gihFp2hmCIa0USh7U1yaUShkL4fkLRCbUmVkn7l8nNQVoRf7UNU4Um-YL4MFL47YM87YUmAFLmLiMN7Jv2bjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47PLRU0LzGDMmLJqdBnx&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=10663&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/ADB0AB30B069B1BDE4FFE80DBD3B2233/3127A2B8/2356A\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 1px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=enmNy8olUDLm-inhNLYnzT2nN7Do7M3kUN7bL47PLmLboRl0gihFp2hmCIa0USh7U1yaUShkL4fkLRCbUmVkn7l8nNQVoRf7UNU4Um-YL4MFL47YM87YUmAFLmLiMN7Jv2bjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47PLRU0LzGDMmLJqdBnx&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=10663&e=.png\"><br></p><p>在校期间，他始终保持勤奋进取的学习状态，平均学分绩点4.06，综合绩点4.17，体测均分达89分。获国家奖学金、综合素质特等奖学金等荣誉；在学科竞赛与科研创新方面表现突出，累计获得国家级奖项四项、省校级奖项十五项，拥有软件著作权四项、发明专利一项，现已推免至厦门大学医学院健康大数据与智能医学专业攻读硕士学位。</p><p><strong>坚定信念，铸魂立身</strong></p><p>自入学以来，王刀郎始终坚定理想信念，积极向党组织靠拢。作为预备党员，他以党员标准严格要求自己。担任班级组织委员期间，他参与筹办多场团建活动，在服务集体的过程中不断提升能力，实现从青涩到成熟的成长与蜕变。</p><p>在社会实践方面，他主动投身疫情防控志愿服务，以实际行动诠释青年担当；在日常学习里，他深耕C语言学习与代码调试，持续培养独立思考能力，将个人成长与集体发展紧密结合、同向同行。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=eL8LyYo7CDLlLZLhzU4nllaUlCbMz-3PMmQVozTRM8WfUm-0gihFp2hmCIa0LYyDLkh2oShfoRlaoz-YLm-YM7VRU46fU4lYM4-snzGiU8WFoz78MRT2o7WFLmM2U4CJv2bjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47PLRU0LzGDMmLJqdBnx&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=10663&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/360F9A8509222224ACC7AC52727E05CB/91449F8B/23FC6\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 349px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=eUmNy4LRvDLRVVnhmrfUln7L8WVLm73DnzNaU474nzTVMml0gihFp2hmCIa0LShVM1hkUShRMlM7Mm62UN-ZL4A7L7-YnRLYUzCPMR7bMm6FnRlDnRCao7QFnRMkLzNJv2bjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47PLRU0LzGDMmLJqdBnx&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=10663&e=.png\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=eUznyknzMkM8lbMh8LDMzliLmLbnRC3bMlWRUNLiMlWVoz-0gihFp2hmCIa0nSyanSyinkyZUmW2LR9iUz6fM8liLRLiolQ2nNW2Lz7iM7QFnmrRM8C4nlWFLmlZnlLJv2bjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47PLRU0LzGDMmLJqdBnx&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=10663&e=.png\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/E0E5D8B2F085A7A7E50359FFFBF1154F/F5C7F3EB/258EC\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 368px\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=eozQyfU4l8LlCbMhlUiozUsM77aLzU3iMm94oRAkL4-DUl-0gihFp2hmCIa0UYy8oShRLYybLzr2ozv8LNrfnlr2LNWRMzAVMm94M7VfLNWFolV7nzMVUzAFnzrRLRlJv2bjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47PLRU0LzGDMmLJqdBnx&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=10663&e=.png\"></p><p><strong>潜心科研，锐意创新</strong></p><p>在学术领域，王刀郎秉持“经磨方能锋利”的信念，持续精进、勇攀高峰。大一学年，他以GPA全院第一的成绩奠定扎实基础；大二期间，他带队研发《诗词词韵APP》，获华北五省计算机设计大赛国家级二等奖，并主持省级创新创业项目，最终以优秀成绩结题，在各类竞赛中，他屡创佳绩，多次获得省级以上奖项。</p><p>实践经历方面，他先后赴中科院沈阳自动化研究所、上海人工智能实验室实习，参与“AI for Science”前沿研究，成功申请国家专利，并投稿两篇ICLR顶级会议论文。他以实干与坚持践行“刀锋所指，郎行千里”的誓言，在科研道路上稳步前进、不断突破。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=eL8-yPnzv8nlCYnhl7YUmlaoRAVozU3sMRvDo7VRozM2Uzv0gihFp2hmCIa0MYhknSyYM1yanNUZM7CsLzLZL4f7MzGaUzLYMR-PLmrfL4VFoRNsLmn7LzMFL4V7Mm7Jv2bjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47PLRU0LzGDMmLJqdBnx&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=10663&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/7BE260FD84F713830D500A3242125A31/89724D13/31D61\" vheight=\" 336.451px\" vwidth=\" 241px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=eL8-yPnzv8nlCYnhl7YUmlaoRAVozU3sMRvDo7VRozM2Uzv0gihFp2hmCIa0MYhknSyYM1yanNUZM7CsLzLZL4f7MzGaUzLYMR-PLmrfL4VFoRNsLmn7LzMFL4V7Mm7Jv2bjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47PLRU0LzGDMmLJqdBnx&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=10663&e=.png\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=eozMyRL7L4L46RUh8Q2M4-8oRlDLml3bMm9ZLNlZnzfkM7-0gihFp2hmCIa0LYhfoSyYMSy4L8-aMzrfnNWRMR9YolWVMzrfLR9ZoR7Zn7QFM4viL8WRo7nFMln7UmGJv2bjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47PLRU0LzGDMmLJqdBnx&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=10663&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/3A92533B055AFBC4829BE55A088818DF/7753BC8D/5DDB0\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 247px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=eozMyRL7L4L46RUh8Q2M4-8oRlDLml3bMm9ZLNlZnzfkM7-0gihFp2hmCIa0LYhfoSyYMSy4L8-aMzrfnNWRMR9YolWVMzrfLR9ZoR7Zn7QFM4viL8WRo7nFMln7UmGJv2bjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47PLRU0LzGDMmLJqdBnx&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=10663&e=.png\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=eM8Wy7nzCinR6VnhRM2LlnfLNL4MNl3snRUioRf7U4CPnNU0gihFp2hmCIa0LYy4U1hkL1hknNLaozUPUz9DM8lDnzliMmf2MmTVL8-8M8WFnzUDMzW7LlMFLz6VMmGJv2bjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47PLRU0LzGDMmLJqdBnx&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=10663&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/33BB2BFC0941A867E6E5560F69E3B47B/E4652D1C/17E60\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 231px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=eM8Wy7nzCinR6VnhRM2LlnfLNL4MNl3snRUioRf7U4CPnNU0gihFp2hmCIa0LYy4U1hkL1hknNLaozUPUz9DM8lDnzliMmf2MmTVL8-8M8WFnzUDMzW7LlMFLz6VMmGJv2bjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47PLRU0LzGDMmLJqdBnx&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=10663&e=.png\"></p><p><strong>知行合一，甘于奉献</strong></p><p><br></p><p>王刀郎在社会实践与志愿服务中积极践行青年责任。疫情防控期间，他主动投身志愿服务一线，因服务细致、表现突出获评“优秀志愿者”。他始终坚持“以行求真、以行求远”，在服务他人、奉献社会的实践中不断锤炼品格、擦亮青春底色。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=eL8Ly8U4VVM77bMhm-DolC4Lz9ZM4A3fMzG8M4laLNC8Mmv0gihFp2hmCIa0LSysUYhRoSyYM4GPUlMVU8Q7MRn2olnVM7Q7nl7Yo7MfM7nFLml4U4n7nmnFLNlYL7-Jv2bjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47PLRU0LzGDMmLJqdBnx&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=10663&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/17CC92701ACECFD44F9DE4FDEA28CA4D/253C4DF4/2E20B\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 391px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=eL8Ly8U4VVM77bMhm-DolC4Lz9ZM4A3fMzG8M4laLNC8Mmv0gihFp2hmCIa0LSysUYhRoSyYM4GPUlMVU8Q7MRn2olnVM7Q7nl7Yo7MfM7nFLml4U4n7nmnFLNlYL7-Jv2bjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47PLRU0LzGDMmLJqdBnx&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=10663&e=.png\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=eLzVyRoRVVLRfknhlrkLzCDn7lbM7M32o7QVolnkn7U4nzl0gihFp2hmCIa0MShVM1hRMYysMmVkMmn2ozG8oRn7Uz98o7WkU8-ZUl7boRMFMzrRMmGbMlQFLm9PM7-Jv2bjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47PLRU0LzGDMmLJqdBnx&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=10663&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/5E6C7761B64F90484DA848BBCB8AA983/55C6095F/2814B\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 392px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=eLzVyRoRVVLRfknhlrkLzCDn7lbM7M32o7QVolnkn7U4nzl0gihFp2hmCIa0MShVM1hRMYysMmVkMmn2ozG8oRn7Uz98o7WkU8-ZUl7boRMFMzrRMmGbMlQFLm9PM7-Jv2bjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47PLRU0LzGDMmLJqdBnx&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=10663&e=.png\"></p><p><strong>青春寄语</strong></p><p>刀要在磨砺中见锋芒，人要在奋斗中见真章。愿以赤诚之心磨砺锋刃，把每一次挑战都当作锻造自我的机会，把每一份热爱都化作脚踏实地的行动；向光而行，在奔赴远方的路上始终保持坚定的方向感与持续的行动力，不断精进、不断突破。愿你以理想为帆、以汗水为桨，不惧路远、不负韶华，在更广阔的舞台上书写属于自己的精彩篇章，做那个“郎行千里”的追梦人。</p><p><strong>栏目简介</strong></p><p>《青春榜样志》聚焦于计算机科学与技术学院涌现出的优秀青年学子，记录他们在学业深耕、科研创新与实践奉献中留下的坚实足迹，展现新时代大学生将个人理想锚定时代需求、勇担使命的昂扬风貌，以榜样之光，照亮更多青年的逐梦航向。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=eM8Wy7nzCinR6VnhRM2LlnfLNL4MNl3snRUioRf7U4CPnNU0gihFp2hmCIa0LYy4U1hkL1hknNLaozUPUz9DM8lDnzliMmf2MmTVL8-8M8WFnzUDMzW7LlMFLz6VMmGJv2bjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47PLRU0LzGDMmLJqdBnx&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=10663&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/33BB2BFC0941A867E6E5560F69E3B47B/E4652D1C/17E60\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 1px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=eM8Wy7nzCinR6VnhRM2LlnfLNL4MNl3snRUioRf7U4CPnNU0gihFp2hmCIa0LYy4U1hkL1hknNLaozUPUz9DM8lDnzliMmf2MmTVL8-8M8WFnzUDMzW7LlMFLz6VMmGJv2bjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47PLRU0LzGDMmLJqdBnx&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=10663&e=.png\"><br></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=eUznyknzMkM8lbMh8LDMzliLmLbnRC3bMlWRUNLiMlWVoz-0gihFp2hmCIa0nSyanSyinkyZUmW2LR9iUz6fM8liLRLiolQ2nNW2Lz7iM7QFnmrRM8C4nlWFLmlZnlLJv2bjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47PLRU0LzGDMmLJqdBnx&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=10663&e=.png\" vspace=\"0\" hspace=\"0\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/E0E5D8B2F085A7A7E50359FFFBF1154F/F5C7F3EB/258EC\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 1px\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=eozQyfU4l8LlCbMhlUiozUsM77aLzU3iMm94oRAkL4-DUl-0gihFp2hmCIa0UYy8oShRLYybLzr2ozv8LNrfnlr2LNWRMzAVMm94M7VfLNWFolV7nzMVUzAFnzrRLRlJv2bjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47PLRU0LzGDMmLJqdBnx&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=10663&e=.png\"><br></p></div><BR><BR></DIV>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://cst.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=eL4AyVLlC4Mz9bLhR6fMlLbUlLZU4M3VM8-aM8UDo7U8LRl0gihFp2hmCIa0n1ysLSyYU1hkUzQRo7CDnz7bU474ozCbLRvbUznRM8L8LRfFoR-ZLNn7oznFLzUao77Jv2bjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47PLRU0LzGDMmLJqdBnx&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=10663&e=.png"}